                        "entry_id": "0482a71e-79e1-349b-aa5a-cd84535a9fd5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A common measure of intensity ratio (e.g. for sound) that is one tenth of a bel on the logarithmic intensity scale. It is defined as dB = 10 log₁₀(P₁ / P₂), where P₁ and P₂ are the relative intensities."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
